{"title":"King Fraser Fir Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 data-end=\"79\" data-start=\"0\" data-section-id=\"nsa3sk\"\u003eBring Home the Timeless Beauty of King Fraser Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"81\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eInspired by the iconic Fraser Firs of the Appalachian Mountains, the King Fraser Fir collection captures the classic charm and natural elegance of a freshly cut Christmas tree. Designed with lush, layered foliage and a traditional conical silhouette, these artificial Christmas trees offer a realistic appearance that feels warm, timeless, and inviting throughout the holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"81\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eAvailable in both full and slim silhouettes, the King Fraser Fir collection makes it easy to find the perfect fit for your space. Whether you’re decorating a grand living room with a full profile tree or adding holiday charm to a smaller area with a slim design, each tree is thoughtfully crafted to deliver the authentic look of a real Fraser Fir without the upkeep of a fresh cut tree.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhy choose the King Fraser Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe King Fraser Fir is the ideal choice for those who want a premium realistic artificial Christmas tree rooted in the timeless character of a natural Fraser Fir. Its mixed PE and PVC branch construction delivers exceptional texture and fullness, closely replicating the layered, dense branch structure of a freshly cut tree. This collection is especially popular among customers transitioning from real Christmas trees to artificial — it preserves the familiar warmth and character of a live tree while offering the convenience, durability, and longevity of a premium artificial Christmas tree. Season after season, the King Fraser Fir holds its shape, stays looking full, and sets up without any of the mess or upkeep of a live tree.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"81\"\u003eIs the King Fraser Fir a realistic Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1430\" data-start=\"1126\"\u003eThe King Fraser Fir is designed to closely resemble the natural structure and fullness of a real Fraser Fir tree. Its layered branch tips, rich green tones, and classic tapered shape create a highly realistic appearance inspired by traditional mountain evergreens commonly used during the holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1690\" data-start=\"1432\"\u003eThis collection is especially popular among customers transitioning from real Christmas trees to artificial options because it maintains the familiar look and feel of a freshly cut tree while offering the convenience and longevity of artificial construction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eShould I choose the full or slim King Fraser Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe King Fraser Fir collection is available in both full and slim silhouettes to suit different spaces and decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe full King Fraser Fir provides a wide, traditional Christmas tree shape with generous branch spread and plenty of room for \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\" title=\"Christmas Ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/ribbons\" title=\"Christmas Ribbon\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e, and decorative garland. It is best suited for larger living rooms or open spaces where you want a premium, realistic tree to serve as the centerpiece of your holiday décor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe slim King Fraser Fir offers the same premium mixed foliage and natural tree character in a narrower, more upright profile. It is a great option for apartments, smaller living rooms, entryways, or corners where a full-width tree would feel oversized without sacrificing the realism and craftsmanship.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the King Fraser Fir available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe King Fraser Fir collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate your decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eOur pre-lit King Fraser Fir artificial Christmas trees feature professionally installed lighting that delivers a warm, even glow throughout the tree. With Power Pole Technology, setup is seamless, with no tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect, and your tree lights up instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the King Fraser Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe King Fraser Fir's rich green foliage and natural-looking silhouette make it a versatile match for virtually any holiday decorating style. It pairs beautifully with traditional red and gold accents, warm white lighting, and heirloom ornament collections. It also complements more modern holiday aesthetics — neutral tones, mixed metallics, and organic textures work equally well against its lush green backdrop. Whether you prefer a fully layered, maximalist look or a clean and understated style, the King Fraser Fir provides a stunning, realistic foundation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the King Fraser Fir easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eYes. The King Fraser Fir is designed for easy setup, reliable long-term use, and convenient after-season storage. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly, making setup quick while creating a full, beautifully shaped tree with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand and complimentary setup gloves to help you shape and fluff the branches during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree protected and in great condition between holiday seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhen the holidays are over, the King Fraser Fir disassembles easily and stores neatly in a cool, dry place, preserving its foliage, shape, and overall condition for many seasons to come.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1690\" data-start=\"1432\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExplore the King Fraser Fir collection to find a realistic artificial Christmas tree that brings warmth, tradition, and lasting holiday memories into your home.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-fraser-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Fraser Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":29211289747520,"sku":"KFF-T7.5-L","price":899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Fraser-Fir-Full-v2_160d23ca-59fa-432f-b172-052001ddf14f.jpg?v=1718158694"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-fraser-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' King Fraser Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":29211290304576,"sku":"KFFS-T6.5-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFraserFirUnlit.jpg?v=1786731058"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-fraser-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' King Fraser Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":29211290435648,"sku":"KFFS-T7.5-U","price":359.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFraserFirUnlit.jpg?v=1786731058"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-fraser-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"9' King Fraser Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":29211290566720,"sku":"KFFS-T9-U","price":449.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFraserFirUnlit.jpg?v=1786731058"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-fraser-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' King Fraser Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":29211290763328,"sku":"KFFS-T6.5-L","price":449.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFraserFirSlim.jpg?v=1786731058"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-fraser-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Fraser Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u0